    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AbaYahudi bamulula abasuku babwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho mumwesi kwekhumi nakhabili, nikwo omwesi kwaAdari, khunyanga yekhumi nakhataru yakwo, olwa lilako liomuruchi nomulome okwa yakhupa bioola ahambi okhwikhola, khunyanga eya abasuku babaYahudi bali nibasuubilanga mbu bakhabaruche; nebutswa kali nikeekaluule, mbu abaYahudi nibo abaruka abo ababakiya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaYahudi bakhung'aana halala mumataala kabwe mungongo tsiosi tsiomuruchi Ahasuwero, okhutiila bosi abakhaabanga okhubakholela libii kata yabulaho oubakaya; okhuba indenga yabahamba abetsimbia tsiosi khulwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata abeemilisi betsingongo, nabakhulundu nabakafuna, nabo bosi abakholanga emilimo chiomuruchi, bakhoonya abaYahudi; okhuba indenga yali niyibahambile khulwa Moridekai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba Moridekai yali omukhongo munzu yomuruchi, ifumaye niyitswana mungongo tsiosi; omundu oyo Moridekai nameetekhanga butswa okhukhongoha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaYahudi nibeera abasuku babwe bosi nibabarema netsinganga, nobwiri nobumululi, nibabakholela aka bachama abo ababakiyanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata muSusa litookho, abaYahudi beera nibamalilana abandu ebikhumi biraano; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibeera nende Parishandatsa, Dalifoni, Asipatsa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Poratsa, Adalia, Aridatsa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Parimashita, Arisai, Aridai, naWaizatsa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abo abaana ekhumi baHamani waHamedatsa, omusuku wabaYahudi; ne ebiyaayo, shibabitiilakhwo ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khunyanga yeneyo omuruchi yaboolelwa obukhumi bwa abo abeerelwa muSusa litookho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi namusunjila Esita omukhayewe ari AbaYahudi beereele nibamalilana abandu ebikhumi biraano muSusa litookho; halala nabaana ekhumi bosi baHamani; kho aka bakhaba nibakholile mungongo tsindi tsiomuruchi kakhaba karie! Kho bulaano lisaayolio lili lirie? Olaheebwa. Kata eshia oshisaba nishiina? Shilakholwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Esita naboola mbu Omuruchi naba nachama, abaYahudi abali muSusa baheebwe omunwa okhukhola nende mukamba, shinga olwa kakhupilwa omulome inyanga yino; khandi mbu abaana abo ekhumi baHamani bafungwe khumusaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuruchi nalaka mbu kabe kario; mana nibakhupa omulome muSusa; nibeelesia abaana ekhumi bosi baHamani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abaYahudi abali nibali eSusa nibakhung'aana halala khandi khunyanga yekhumi nakhane eyomumwesi kwaAdari, nibeerela abandu ebikhumi bitaru muSusa; ne ebiyaayo, shibabitiilakhwo ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lisabo liaPurimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaYahudi abali nibali mungongo tsiomuruchi nibakhung'aana halala okhusinjilila akobulamu bwabwe, nibaba nobuhuluushi khukabasuku babwe, nibeera khubabakiyanga abandu ebikhumila amakhumi musaafu nabiraano; ne ebiyaayo, shibabitiilakhwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ako keekhola khunyanga yekhumi nakhataru eyomumwesi kwaAdari; mana khunyanga yekhumi nakhane eyomumwesi tsana bahuluukha, nibachikhola inyanga yamasabo nokhutsatsahala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula abaYahudi abali muSusa bakhung'aana omwesi nikuli ekhumi nakhataru khandi nende ekhumi nakhane; mana nikuli ekhumi nakharaano, bahuluukha nibachikhola inyanga yamasabo nokhutsatsahala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, abaYahudi abomubisoma, nabamenya mumataala akabula tsingoba, bakholanga inyanga yekhumi nakhane eyomwesi kwaAdari yibe inyanga yokhutsatsahala neyamasabo, eshikukuu, inyanga yokhukoobelana emikabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Moridekai nahandiika amakhuwa ako, nabayilila tsibarwa abaYahudi bosi abali mungongo tsiosi tsiomuruchi Ahasuwero, etsiahambi netsiehale pe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okhubabiila mbu balindenje inyanga yekhumi nakhane eyomumwesi kwaAdari, nende eyekhumi nakharaano eyomumwesi tsana, omuyika buli muyika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shinga olwa tsiali tsindaalo etsia abaYahudi banyoolelamwo obuhuluushi khubasuku babwe, khandi omwesi okwa bakalusilibwa obutsatsahafu mushilenje shieshibeela, eshikukuu mushilenje shiamasika; mbu batsikhole tsibe tsindaalo tsiamasabo nobutsatsahafu, neyokhukoobelana emikabo, neyokhuyilila abamanani ebihaanwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbaYahudi nibafuchiilila okhukholanga shinga olwa bachaachile, khandi shinga Moridekai olwa abahandiichiile; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shichila Hamani waHamedatsa, omuAgagi, omusuku wabaYahudi bosi, yali nakholile mumachesike amakhuwa khubaYahudi okhubatibia, nakhupile Puri, eshisina mbu ikha, okhubamalilana nokhubatibia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa olwa amakhuwa koola imbeli womuruchi, yalaka mutsibarwa mbu tsiyemitsie tsimbii etsia yali nakholile mumachesike khukabaYahudi tsikalushile khumurwe kukwe omwene; khandi mbu ye nabaanabe bafungwe khumusaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko akachila nibakulikha tsindaalo etsio mbu Purimu, khulwa eliira liaPuri. Kho khulwa amakhuwa kosi keibarwa tsana, nokhulwa kosi aka bali nibaluutsi khumakhuwa tsana, nakali nikabakwiliile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaYahudi basinjisia likhuwa, nibeetuukha abeene nabaana babwe, nabosi abakhaba nibeeyunjile khubo, lileshe okhuchweyekha; eliene ndielino, mbu bakhalindanga tsindaalo etsio tsibili, lihandiiko liatsio shinga olwa liali, neinduukho yatsio, omuyika buli muyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
